{"id": "unknown-2026-07-20-006", "date": "2026-07-20", "time_tags": {"year": 2026, "quarter": "Q3", "month": 7, "week": 30, "weekday": "Mon"}, "entities": {"companies": [], "customers": [], "suppliers": []}, "topics": ["earnings"], "sentiment": {"label": "neutral", "score": 0.0, "keywords": ["growth", "slow"]}, "importance": {"score": 0.75, "reasons": ["涉及財報"]}, "title": "Fitch affirms Turkiye at 'BB-'; outlook stable; growth to slow to 2.8%", "content": "Fitch Ratings recently affirmed Turkiye's long-term issuer default ratings at 'BB minus' with a stable outlook. \nIt forecast GDP growth in the country would slow by 0.8 pp this year to 2.8 per cent, before accelerating to 4.4 per cent in 2027. \nFitch projects inflation will fall from 32 per cent in June to 29.5 per cent at end-2026 and 18 per cent at end-2028, still the highest of any sovereign it rates. ", "sources": [{"name": "fibre2fashion_textile", "url": "https://www.fibre2fashion.com/news/textile-news/fitch-affirms-turkiye-at-bb-outlook-stable-growth-to-slow-to-2-8--311882-newsdetails.htm", "type": "rss"}]}
{"id": "unknown-2026-07-20-007", "date": "2026-07-20", "time_tags": {"year": 2026, "quarter": "Q3", "month": 7, "week": 30, "weekday": "Mon"}, "entities": {"companies": [], "customers": [], "suppliers": []}, "topics": ["supply_chain_shift"], "sentiment": {"label": "neutral", "score": 0.0, "keywords": ["increase", "[否定]concerns", "weak", "delay"]}, "importance": {"score": 0.5, "reasons": []}, "title": "Weak monsoon sends India's cotton sowing to multi-year low", "content": "India's cotton sowing fell 15.33 per cent year on year to 79.54 lakh hectares as of July 10 due to delayed and uneven monsoon rains, raising concerns over another weak crop.\nThe acreage is also well below the five-year average.\nWith 2025-26 production already at an eight-year low, a smaller crop could tighten domestic supplies and increase import dependence if mill demand remains firm.", "sources": [{"name": "fibre2fashion_textile", "url": "https://www.fibre2fashion.com/news/textile-news/weak-monsoon-sends-india-s-cotton-sowing-to-multi-year-low-311876-newsdetails.htm", "type": "rss"}]}
{"id": "unknown-2026-07-20-008", "date": "2026-07-20", "time_tags": {"year": 2026, "quarter": "Q3", "month": 7, "week": 30, "weekday": "Mon"}, "entities": {"companies": [], "customers": [], "suppliers": []}, "topics": ["supply_chain_shift"], "sentiment": {"label": "positive", "score": 0.5, "keywords": ["expand"]}, "importance": {"score": 0.5, "reasons": []}, "title": "India, Estonia strengthen digital economy partnership", "content": "India and Estonia agreed to expand digital governance, fintech, cybersecurity and emerging-technology cooperation during Piyush Goyal’s Europe visit.\nEstonia backed early India-EU FTA implementation, relevant to textile and apparel exporters, importers and sourcing teams.\nThe wider tour advanced trade, investment and technology talks, including investment protection and geographical indications.", "sources": [{"name": "fibre2fashion_textile", "url": "https://www.fibre2fashion.com/news/textile-news/india-estonia-strengthen-digital-economy-partnership-311872-newsdetails.htm", "type": "rss"}]}
{"id": "unknown-2026-07-20-009", "date": "2026-07-20", "time_tags": {"year": 2026, "quarter": "Q3", "month": 7, "week": 30, "weekday": "Mon"}, "entities": {"companies": [], "customers": [], "suppliers": []}, "topics": ["supply_chain_shift", "earnings"], "sentiment": {"label": "positive", "score": 0.5, "keywords": ["increase"]}, "importance": {"score": 0.75, "reasons": ["涉及財報"]}, "title": "Indian polyester raw material prices rebound on stronger crude oil", "content": "Indian polyester raw material prices rebounded during the week as higher upstream feedstock costs lifted domestic prices.\nPTA and melt prices increased, while MEG remained unchanged.\nPolyester filament yarn producers also raised FDY, POY and PTY prices.\nIn China, PTA and MEG strengthened on firmer energy markets.\nThe near-term outlook remains firm, supported by global feedstock trends.", "sources": [{"name": "fibre2fashion_textile", "url": "https://www.fibre2fashion.com/news/textile-news/indian-polyester-raw-material-prices-rebound-on-stronger-crude-oil-311874-newsdetails.htm", "type": "rss"}]}
{"id": "unknown-2026-07-20-010", "date": "2026-07-20", "time_tags": {"year": 2026, "quarter": "Q3", "month": 7, "week": 30, "weekday": "Mon"}, "entities": {"companies": [], "customers": [], "suppliers": []}, "topics": ["supply_chain_shift"], "sentiment": {"label": "neutral", "score": 0.0, "keywords": []}, "importance": {"score": 0.5, "reasons": []}, "title": "Vietnam's H1 export surge masks a looming US tariff shock", "content": "Vietnam’s H1 2026 gains came from shipment front-loading before the July 24 US tariff deadline, with Q1 apparel imports up 2.5 per cent to $4.02 billion. \nReplacing the 10 per cent Section 122 duty with a 12.5 per cent Section 301 tariff would add about $425 million in annual duties. \nFabric (+20.7%) and fibre (+57.2%) imports surged as buyers built inventories ahead of the tariff reset.", "sources": [{"name": "fibre2fashion_textile", "url": "https://www.fibre2fashion.com/news/textile-news/vietnam-s-h1-export-surge-masks-a-looming-us-tariff-shock-311859-newsdetails.htm", "type": "rss"}]}
{"id": "hm-2026-07-20-011", "date": "2026-07-20", "time_tags": {"year": 2026, "quarter": "Q3", "month": 7, "week": 30, "weekday": "Mon"}, "entities": {"companies": ["hm"], "customers": [], "suppliers": []}, "topics": ["supply_chain_shift"], "sentiment": {"label": "neutral", "score": 0.0, "keywords": []}, "importance": {"score": 0.5, "reasons": []}, "title": "Bangladesh factory closures trigger global sourcing shift", "content": "457 factories have closed since August 2024, including 155 in Gazipur, as gas shortages keep many units at 50-60 per cent capacity. \nJanuary-May 2026: Bangladesh’s US exports fell 8.1 per cent, EU (-18.89%); Vietnam (+1.5%), Cambodia (+14.9%) and Indonesia (+5.5%) gained.\nH&M is shifting part of its ~$5 billion Bangladesh sourcing to India, turning buyer diversification into active reallocation.", "sources": [{"name": "fibre2fashion_textile", "url": "https://www.fibre2fashion.com/news/textile-news/bangladesh-factory-closures-trigger-global-sourcing-shift-311863-newsdetails.htm", "type": "rss"}]}
